<view class="page"
  ><text class="title">验证器丢失恢复</text
  ><text class="notice"
    >恢复不能绕过MFA：必须由本人重新微信登录发起，再由另一名已完成MFA的同组织管理员复核。批准后旧验证器和本人全部会话立即失效。</text
  ><button loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="refresh">
    刷新状态</button
  ><view wx:if="{{memberships.length}}" class="card"
    ><text class="subtitle">选择所属组织</text
    ><view wx:for="{{memberships}}" wx:key="organizationId" class="row"
      ><view
        ><text>{{item.organizationId}}</text
        ><text class="muted">身份：{{item.role}}</text></view
      ><button
        size="mini"
        disabled="{{busy}}"
        data-organization-id="{{item.organizationId}}"
        bindtap="requestRecovery"
      >
        本人重新登录并申请
      </button></view
    ></view
  ><text wx:else class="muted">当前微信身份没有授权工作人员资格。</text
  ><view wx:if="{{requests.length}}" class="card"
    ><text class="subtitle">最近申请</text
    ><view wx:for="{{requests}}" wx:key="id" class="request"
      ><text
        >{{item.organizationName || item.organizationId}} ·
        {{item.status}}</text
      ><text class="muted">申请：{{item.createdAt}}</text
      ><text class="muted">到期：{{item.expiresAt}}</text
      ><button
        wx:if="{{item.status === 'PENDING'}}"
        size="mini"
        disabled="{{busy}}"
        data-request-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="cancelRecovery"
      >
        取消本人申请
      </button></view
    ></view
  ><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</text></view
>
